## PREAMBLE: WHY DOES THIS EXIST?

This project exists because someone decided that people visiting a website through AI-generated links deserve to be publicly humiliated by a JavaScript popup.

We have collectively failed as a species.

By downloading, viewing, running, copying, forking, compiling, thinking about, or accidentally breathing near this software, you acknowledge that you have approximately 47 browser tabs open and at least one of them is playing music.

