Failure to comply within ten seconds shall result in absolutely nothing whatsoever, because this is a fucking popup, not an international tribunal.

The developer reserves the right to add more AI companies to the shame list whenever another company releases a chatbot that can summarize a PDF and confidently get three paragraphs wrong.

